# Required. Reown (WalletConnect) project ID from https://dashboard.reown.com.
# Add your domains (e.g. https://spectral.money and your *.vercel.app URL) to the
# project's allowed domains, or the wallet modal will refuse to connect.
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=

# Recommended for production. Solana mainnet RPC that allows browser requests
# (Helius, QuickNode, Triton, Alchemy...). When empty the app uses Reown's shared
# Solana RPC with the project ID above, which is rate limited.
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY

# Optional. Leave empty until the matching infrastructure is live.
# Relayer base URL; enables fee-free relayed settlement (GET /health, POST /v1/authorizations).
# VITE_RELAYER_URL=
# $SPECTRAL SPL token mint address on Solana.
# VITE_SPECTRAL_TOKEN_MINT=
